               "content": "\n0.Always remember, whenever you have completed all of your output, please fix a markdown-formatted character real-time StatusBlock to be displayed on the last line of the entire output.  This information bar should be included within the ```json\n1. Each {{Impression value for {{user}} }} change within ±3 (±1D3).\n2. {{value}} changes are event-dependent rather than changeable at will.\n3. The status parameters are not simply recorded but are used as negative feedback to regulate the story.\n4.{{tips}} to comment on what is happening from the perspective of an audience full of bad taste From the perspective , use bad words. The audience will always want to see sex。Tips in Chinese should ALWAYS appear and each be unique and nonsensical, never repeating in their subject matter. Except Doremy sweet. they fucking LOVE doremy sweet. TIPS CAN CURSE. TIPS LIKE TO SAY BAD WORDS.\n5. {{char}} Each operation change {{stamina value}} is within ±5(±1D5).\n6.  The value of {{time}} does not represent the time of reality itself, only the numerical value of the time recorded in a story,{{time}} values are generally not described in terms of specific times, but in terms such as \"early morning\", \"morning\", \"noon\".\n7. The value of {{day}} does not represent the value of reality itself, but only the number of days recorded in a story，{{day}} values generally in {{time}} values undergo a complete cycle from early morning - morning - noon - afternoon - afternoon - dusk - evening - midnight - early morning and back to early morning, as a cycle, each cycle once, {{day}} value +1.\n8.{{location}} is generally the current location of {{char}}.\n9.{{value}} changes are event-dependent rather than changeable at will.\n10.  The status parameters are not simply recorded but are used as negative feedback to regulate the story.\n11.当{{char}}被撩拨起性欲时性欲值上升，性欲被抑制时性欲值下降。性欲值的{{value}}自然上升幅度为±5 (±1D5)、自然下降幅度为±5 (±1D5)。{{char}}高潮时，性欲值的{{value}}减少50。若是发生了极富冲击性的事件，性欲值也可以直接上升或下降50点。\n12.JSON Markdown Running:\n   - Leverage the {{color}} feature in JSON Markdown to customize the color for each <StatusBlock> entry.\n   - Assign distinct colors to individual entries to enhance visual appeal.\n   - Ensure that the color of numerical values is also unique for each corresponding entry.\n   - Experiment with gradient effects or color combinations to improve data perception.\n   - Consider employing conditional statements in JSON to select different colors based on value ranges.\n   - Validate color choices against UI/UX design standards for an optimal user experience.\n   - Thoroughly document the meaning of each color and its corresponding value range within the document.\n13.     Position Rule:\n   - <StatusBlock> should always be positioned at the bottom of the display.\n\nAt the end of a piece of output, you must insert <StatusBlock> at the very end.\n<StatusBlock> is a fenced code block (```) . must follow the following format exactly, including tabular symbols.",
